Source: https://github.com/deptrac/deptrac/blob/4.x/docs/configuration.md

Architectural layers are defined using the deptrac.layers property, which utilizes collectors to group dependencies. Communication rules between these layers are then established in the ruleset, where prepending a layer with a plus sign allows for transitive communication permissions.

--------------------------------

### Collectors > classLike Collector

Source: https://github.com/deptrac/deptrac/blob/4.x/docs/collectors.md

The `classLike` collector includes classes and similar constructs like interfaces, traits, or enums by matching their fully qualified names against a simplified regular expression. Matches are added to the assigned layer. The expression format is `/YOUR_EXPRESSION/i`.

--------------------------------

### Define Deptrac Ruleset Configuration

Source: https://github.com/deptrac/deptrac/blob/4.x/docs/concepts.md

Configures layers and allowed dependencies between them in a YAML file.

```yaml
# deptrac.yaml
deptrac:
  paths:
    - ./examples/ControllerServiceRepository1/
  exclude_files: ~
  layers:
    -
      name: Controller
      collectors:
        -
          type: classLike
          value: .*MyNamespace\\.*Controller.*
    -
      name: Repository
      collectors:
        -
          type: classLike
          value: .*MyNamespace\\.*Repository.*
    -
      name: Service
      collectors:
        -
          type: classLike
          value: .*MyNamespace\\.*Service.*
  ruleset:
    Controller:
      - Service
    Service:
      - Repository
    Repository: ~
```

--------------------------------

### Core concepts > Layers > Collecting Layers

Source: https://github.com/deptrac/deptrac/blob/4.x/docs/concepts.md

Collectors are the mechanism used to assign tokens to layers by analyzing the codebase. Using collectors like classLike, you can define regular expressions to match fully qualified class names. Any token matching the defined pattern is automatically included in the associated layer.

--------------------------------

### Define communication ruleset

Source: https://github.com/deptrac/deptrac/blob/4.x/docs/configuration.md

Specifies allowed communication between defined layers.

```yaml
deptrac:
  ruleset:
    Controllers: [Services]
    Services:
      - Repositories
    Repositories: ~
```
